":"listing","what":"凭单B转换新股上市","what_en":"Listing of new shares from Warrant B conversion","ann":"11698681","link":"https://www.klsescreener.com/v2/announcements/view/11698681","src":"ai"},{"date":"2026-12-31","type":"results_due","what":"下一季 (10 月底结束) 季报最迟公布日 · 交易所规定","what_en":"Deadline for the quarter ending Oct (Bursa rule)","src":"rule"}],"recent_en":"XL Holdings recently saw multiple listings of new shares from Warrant B conversions, with issued share capital rising. It also disclosed that actual recurrent related party transactions for shrimp post-larvae sales to MASB exceeded the estimated mandate value by more than 10%. Separately, the company's auditor resigned over audit fees in September 2026.","notable_en":["Ongoing Warrant B conversions with multiple batches of new shares listed from October to November 2026, raising issued share capital to about 527 million shares.","Actual recurrent related party transactions for shrimp post-larvae sales to MASB exceeded the estimated mandate value by 61.65%.","An EGM was held on 15 October 2026, approving the renewal and new shareholders' mandate for recurrent related party transactions."],"risks_en":["The auditor resigned over audit fees.","Ongoing Warrant B conversions increase issued share capital and may dilute equity.","Actual recurrent related party transaction values exceeded the estimated mandate, warranting attention to further disclosures."],"earnings_en":"For the quarter ended 31 July 2026, revenue was RM45.0 million, up 27.1% QoQ and 151.0% YoY; net income was RM1.554 million, down 56.3% QoQ and 40.7% YoY; net margin was 3.5% versus 10.1% in the prior quarter."}